{"cast":{"Akio":"salaryman_04","Father":"salaryman_03","Fujita":"salaryman_05","Gondō":"salaryman_07","Ishikawa":"salaryman_02","Mori":"officelady_01","Mother":"woman_05","Nakano":"officelady_03","Receptionist":"officelady_02","Seiko":"seiko","Sister":"woman_02","Takeda":"officelady_04","Ōtsuka":"salaryman_08"},"lines":{"Akio|And to our newest floor manager. Kanpai!":{"dur":3.445,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/akio_379f1435c6bf.ogg","who":"Akio"},"Akio|Customer service. Third floor. The calls nobody else wants.":{"dur":4.47,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/akio_08932b4eb282.ogg","who":"Akio"},"Akio|Everyone! A toast. To 3F, the hardest-working floor in SOTI.":{"dur":5.32,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/akio_82eacf101886.ogg","who":"Akio"},"Akio|My grandfather built this company on one rule. Be where you said you would be.":{"dur":5.57,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/akio_912321eb29e3.ogg","who":"Akio"},"Akio|Thank you, Gondō. Very… moving. Seiko! The company song. You know it?":{"dur":5.02,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/akio_635f29ec5faf.ogg","who":"Akio"},"Akio|You start tomorrow. Do not be late again.":{"dur":3.095,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/akio_0cd2f36f696b.ogg","who":"Akio"},"Akio|You're late.":{"dur":1.47,"fps":30,"m":"00000000000000000000000000000000000110002110085100a6200c5800d3e0062700433006a2007d1008f000cg000dh000ch0009j0006f0005k0005k0004g0003a000270001500015000140001400014000130000200001000000000000000000000000000000000","src":"audio/voice/akio_89b285b46028.ogg","who":"Akio"},"Akio|You're late. Very late.":{"dur":2.07,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/akio_eebcd0a274eb.ogg","who":"Akio"},"Akio|Your file says you can talk to anyone. We'll see.":{"dur":3.57,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/akio_592697aecc16.ogg","who":"Akio"},"Driver|Nine? Hold on to something.":{"dur":2.645,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/driver_d0a8f274ef9d.ogg","who":"Driver"},"Driver|Right away.":{"dur":1.745,"fps":30,"m":"000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000010010100202006090080c0091c0072600h6300fc100bj1008j1007f100372002451032k6041q6041q6022c20236107a3108e1009g1008h0004c00039000280002800017000170001700017000160001600003000010000100000000000000000000000","src":"audio/voice/driver_7cf3ce3bcf9b.ogg","who":"Driver"},"Everyone|Kanpai!":{"dur":1.545,"fps":30,"m":"0000000000000000000000000000000000000000110002100065000a7000d8000n8000p8000fc0109d0206d040491j0242u0222u0221c032160d5030g8010ed0109k0007l0004e0002a0002900018000170001700017000160001600003000010000100000000000000000000000","src":"audio/voice/everyone_58204a015e1c.ogg","who":"Everyone"},"Father|…Make us proud, Seiko.":{"dur":3.07,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/father_b1236184d3f4.ogg","who":"Father"},"Gondō|(muttering) Or come to me. I'm the senior one.":{"dur":3.12,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/gond_a305645547a1.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|And Seiko? The customer is always right. Even when they're idiots.":{"dur":5.22,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_1c8cee15b9ef.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|Answer the phone. Be polite. Don't make me look bad.":{"dur":4.12,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_88449d2f8ea4.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|As of today he is… also… floor manager. With me. Co-floor manager.":{"dur":5.97,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_a5c341105a14.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|Everyone! Eyes up. Headsets down. This is Seiko.":{"dur":4.17,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_05891ac1efca.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|Gondō Tetsuo. Head of Customer Care. Nineteen years on this floor.":{"dur":5.77,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_2ee383ffd39e.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|He likes the way you work. He says you talk to people like they're people.":{"dur":5.07,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_26ddee6cf107.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|I don't see it. But he's the grandson of the founder, so.":{"dur":4.27,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_46daa5cd16f6.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|I'll handle strategy. Seiko handles… problems. People problems. Floor problems.":{"dur":6.645,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_42f184c33a93.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|SEIKO! My office. Now.":{"dur":2.77,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_c895f35bb9f0.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|Sit. Don't touch anything.":{"dur":2.52,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_6e6d1b9d9958.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|So you're Akio-sama's little discovery. Hmph.":{"dur":4.595,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_320393716e2f.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|Sotiyama-sama — Akio-sama — has been listening to your calls.":{"dur":5.32,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_cb5c6cb902fc.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|There's a company car. Don't scratch it. Fuel's on you — SOTI isn't a charity.":{"dur":5.795,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_1441f9d762b2.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|Together with me. Co-floor managers. Equal. On paper.":{"dur":4.545,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_b58cba28cfc2.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|Tomorrow you start. And Seiko… nineteen years. Remember that.":{"dur":5.045,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_e8bc7146d4be.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|You're promoted. Floor manager.":{"dur":2.97,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_2c65d9b2b18d.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Gondō|Your desk is by the window. Laptop's on it. Headset's in the drawer.":{"dur":5.195,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/gond_06db3e3ca75b.ogg","who":"Gondō"},"Ishikawa|I'm going to tell everyone. Tomorrow. If I remember.":{"dur":4.02,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/ishikawa_469beb082fcc.ogg","who":"Ishikawa"},"Ishikawa|My train… last train… my wife will kill me…":{"dur":3.82,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/ishikawa_93d59d471d64.ogg","who":"Ishikawa"},"Ishikawa|Seikooo… the ground's moving. Is the ground moving?":{"dur":4.045,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/ishikawa_1592ecf7673d.ogg","who":"Ishikawa"},"Ishikawa|Seiko… you're a good man. A good floor manager. The best.":{"dur":4.345,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/ishikawa_c67bad99e56e.ogg","who":"Ishikawa"},"Mori|(whispering) He does this every time.":{"dur":2.17,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/mori_8196f9f47235.ogg","who":"Mori"},"Mori|Two managers. Wonderful. Twice the meetings.":{"dur":3.22,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/mori_1133fbd91eaa.ogg","who":"Mori"},"Mother|Eat properly! And call us every Sunday!":{"dur":3.245,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/mother_c9fb7844a01a.ogg","who":"Mother"},"Mother|Seiko! Call us when you get there!":{"dur":2.645,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/mother_23f30e196251.ogg","who":"Mother"},"Mother|Seiko! The train won't wait!":{"dur":2.57,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/mother_2b6c791837fa.ogg","who":"Mother"},"Nakano|I owe you. Karaoke's on me. Forever.":{"dur":3.92,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/nakano_bcf9f7e53288.ogg","who":"Nakano"},"Nakano|SEIKO-SAN! You're a lifesaver! Thank you thank you thank you!":{"dur":5.745,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/nakano_666fa827763f.ogg","who":"Nakano"},"Nakano|…You didn't look at anything, right? Right. Of course not.":{"dur":5.695,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/nakano_6339dac9392f.ogg","who":"Nakano"},"Receptionist|Gondō-buchō is expecting you. Good luck… you'll need it.":{"dur":4.12,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/receptionist_3394296ba10a.ogg","who":"Receptionist"},"Receptionist|Good morning! You must be Seiko-san.":{"dur":2.82,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/receptionist_0d888fad3481.ogg","who":"Receptionist"},"Receptionist|Good morning, Seiko-san! Your pass. Customer Care is on the third floor.":{"dur":4.895,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/receptionist_4e91248bf137.ogg","who":"Receptionist"},"Receptionist|Sotiyama-sama is expecting you. Top floor — the lift is on your right.":{"dur":5.17,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/receptionist_fb2c5ba69dce.ogg","who":"Receptionist"},"Seiko|(Everyone is looking at you.)":{"dur":2.17,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/seiko_7356e84bec86.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|(Floor manager. One step closer.)":{"dur":2.87,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/seiko_e53816ce85a6.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|Eight forty-two… I'm gonna be late!":{"dur":2.745,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_e68feda7bf1f.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|F-floor manager? Me?":{"dur":2.22,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_c26f4286e651.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|Hai! Thank you, Sotiyama-sama!":{"dur":2.545,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_bb902d6fa3a5.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|Hai.":{"dur":1.195,"fps":30,"m":"000000000000000000000000000000110002100065000860006300073000k5000p7000q9000le000el0009n0007n0004f0002b00029000180001700016000130000100001000000000000000000000000000000000","src":"audio/voice/seiko_f4c91b548102.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|Here we go.":{"dur":1.545,"fps":30,"m":"00000000000000000000000000000011000110004500077000461007f2007d70077c1065l605ah305g8104941088300a730064500a2g00b1l00b0o0090q0060s0050r0030h0020c0010a001090010800108001080010800107001070000300002000010000000000000000000000","src":"audio/voice/seiko_b7b39164fccd.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|Huh…? Where—":{"dur":1.595,"fps":30,"m":"00000000000000000000000000000011000110005500076000430003200093000940004210021100102001051030k6041q6051q6043d209a610bd410be3009a60075a0062c00318002160020500104001040010400104001040010300002000010000000000000000000000000000000000000","src":"audio/voice/seiko_37aa789b882f.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|I will. I promise.":{"dur":1.945,"fps":30,"m":"0000000000000000000000000100002100032000d6000fc100bj2009l4107ai6066n6046b207g5107i2107f10068100i8000l8000fb0108812044140323u0416j071a9091b50h4640i5360933u0423u0333u0392m04i1a05m1505l0204h0103a0102700015000150001400014000140001400014000140001300002000010000000000000000000000000000","src":"audio/voice/seiko_59f9dc0e1258.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|I'll do my best. If you have a problem, come to me.":{"dur":3.57,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_d40894601a45.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|M-moushiwake gozaimasen! Terribly sorry!":{"dur":3.77,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_ff02db689424.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|SOTI Tower, here I come.":{"dur":2.245,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_471e329ba736.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|SOTI Tower, please — and please hurry. I have an interview at nine!":{"dur":4.795,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_44d7240cb223.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|SOTI… SOTI wants to meet me?!":{"dur":2.52,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_8fec8b2522b0.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|Seiko desu. Yoroshiku onegaishimasu!":{"dur":3.92,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_8bf3a3c86a04.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|Today's the day.":{"dur":1.72,"fps":30,"m":"0000000000000000000000000000001100012000480007900098000ba000ac00078000ce000cj000an0008o0006l0006h0006b00079000a80009b0007c00047000350008c0009f0009h0008j0006l0004e0002a000290001800017000170001700017000170001600016000030000100001000000000000000000","src":"audio/voice/seiko_d24f7f86dec7.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|Tōkonto Central. I made it.":{"dur":2.595,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_ad04afbb0fb0.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|“Dress sharp.”":{"dur":1.545,"fps":30,"m":"0000000000000000000000000000001100012100482007850095a00a4b00db500ce3009e1007d100462003330062b0071e0061700h4300k5200j5200b380061610314102034010270001800018000180001900019000180001800017000030000200001000000000000000000000","src":"audio/voice/seiko_9e2d2b1c00a0.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Seiko|…In these? I need to freshen up.":{"dur":2.595,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/seiko_e6167ba3e29a.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"Sister|Bye bye, Onii-chan! Byeee!":{"dur":2.67,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/sister_c3780c8c1419.ogg","who":"Sister"},"Sister|Onii-chan! Bring me something from the city!":{"dur":3.345,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/sister_0d483b7294b3.ogg","who":"Sister"},"|(One day, this office will be mine.)":{"dur":2.62,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/seiko_e87e747b4ac7.ogg","who":"Seiko"},"|Fourteen million people. And somewhere in it, a job with his name on it.":{"dur":5.27,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/narrator_e8e90adc7117.ogg","who":""},"|He doesn't sign.":{"dur":2.045,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/narrator_5b893324bbd8.ogg","who":""},"|Mizuho. Rice terraces, one road, and a train twice a day.":{"dur":4.52,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/narrator_970d4e4d817e.ogg","who":""},"|Please stand behind the yellow line.":{"dur":2.845,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/pa_d2bb50127dd9.ogg","who":"PA"},"|Seiko watched the village until the mountains took it.":{"dur":3.745,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/narrator_6bfcd2d40e29.ogg","who":""},"|Six SOTI people, one small room, too many tambourines.":{"dur":4.395,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/narrator_960f438678c7.ogg","who":""},"|Two hundred calls an hour. Twenty-three people. One Gondō.":{"dur":4.395,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/narrator_83edbaa69a45.ogg","who":""},"|You're late. Everyone noticed.":{"dur":2.745,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/narrator_b76ffab8b316.ogg","who":""},"|Ōtsuka-san signs the renewal.":{"dur":3.12,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/narrator_299f32986db5.ogg","who":""},"|♪ まもなく、電車が参ります。 The train is now arriving.":{"dur":2.295,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/pa_419977ebfd89.ogg","who":"PA"},"|♪ ドアが閉まります。 Doors closing.":{"dur":1.87,"fps":30,"src":"audio/voice/pa_71b1dcefee2d.ogg","who":"PA"},"Ōtsuka|Hah! You're alright, Seiko-kun. Give me the pen.":{"dur":3.87,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/tsuka_c5d8b0f9c7c3.ogg","who":"Ōtsuka"},"Ōtsuka|I'll think about it. Tell Gondō I'll call him.":{"dur":3.72,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/tsuka_fd4c952c9dbc.ogg","who":"Ōtsuka"},"Ōtsuka|You must be Gondō's floor manager. Sit, sit. Whisky?":{"dur":4.47,"fps":30,"m":"","src":"audio/voice/tsuka_c7af5bbdb381.ogg","who":"Ōtsuka"}},"note":"Generated by Tools/voice/build_voices.py (Kokoro-82M TTS, Apache-2.0). Do not edit by hand."}